OL,3,GNEWSA'Loo enthusiast' creates app for
OL,4,Arating toilets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA self-described "loo enthusiast" has
OL,7,Fcreated a website and app where people
OL,8,Fcan rate their local toilets.
OL,10,FYolanda Cuevas-Beck said she made
OL,11,FPorcelain Report to flush out the best
OL,12,Fpublic bathrooms by allowing members of
OL,13,Fthe community to score them across
OL,14,Fseveral factors.
OL,16,F"It is important to have a beautiful
OL,17,Ftoilet," she told the BBC. "Sometimes
OL,18,Festablishments forget that.
OL,20,F"My mum told me back in the day you can
OL,21,Falways tell what the kitchen's like by
OL,22,Fgoing in the bathroom."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
